I know exactly what caused this!
When you replaced the **Delete Action** code in your last step, you accidentally deleted the closing </Grid> tag for the main row container. Because the Grid was left open, React got confused and crashed when it hit the <JournalBulkUpload> component later down the file.
Also, it looks like the **Reset** button was missing from your Action Buttons section, so we will fix both issues at the same time.
### The Fix
Open your file and scroll down to around **line 1290**. Find the {/* Delete Action */} section, and carefully replace everything from there down to the end of the {/* ACTION BUTTONS */} box.
**Find this exact block in your code:**
```javascript
